Hi Lukas,
I'm glad to hear you're happy with shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> so far.

Our pricing plans are all here (scroll down a bit): http://www.rstudio.com/products/shinyapps/

The Free plan is intended (but not limited) for students and researchers who do not need the additional features of our paid plans; and the paid plans are all less expensive than Shiny Server Pro even at the 50% discounted price for academic research. Does that seem reasonable?

An important planning assumption for shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> is that we can price it below Shiny Server Pro even though we're hosting the computing infrastructure because it requires no / very little cost of sales. All purchases are by credit card and all plans apply to everybody so we don't have to qualify anyone for special pricing. Does that make sense?

Thanks for the feedback.

Roger

