Hi Roger,

Thanks for the information. I should have mentioned that I was asking mainly because of the 50 active hours limit on free accounts, not the additional features.

We had a few users accessing our app in the lab, and I noticed we were getting close to 50 hours per month - so we were thinking about how to manage this, or possibly move to a higher tier plan at the end of the beta period (depending on funding etc). I could also imagine that 50 hours could be too little in some teaching settings, for example if a large group of students were asked to access a shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> app for an exercise in a university tutorial or assignment.

I understand the point about minimizing cost of sales and admin.

Thanks for the response and best regards,
Lukas

