> An important planning assumption for shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> is that we can price it below Shiny Server Pro even though we're hosting the computing infrastructure because it requires no / very little cost of sales. All purchases are by credit card and all plans apply to everybody so we don't have to qualify anyone for special pricing. Does that make sense?
