After deploying an app to shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io/>, I feel like there should be a way to retrieve/download the source code or at least see what version is currently deployed. Because right now after deployment you just lose the source and I can never know how different the deployed version is from my local/git version, if at all.  Are there any plans to support this in any way?

