I have tried your application half a dozen times, but I haven't seen the grey screen.  If you happen to see it again, would you mind opening up the javascript console and seeing what errors if any are in there?

As for the logs you see, I believe all the dates are in UTC time, not sure if that addresses your concern with the logs.

